CHAPTER.VERS:
O you

          {+}
         sons of a man, how long will my glory be turned into dishonor? Will you

          {+}
         love vanity? Will you

          {+}
         seek after falsehood? Selah.

Stand in awe, and don't sin: Commune with your

          {+}
         own heart on your

          {+}
         bed, and be still. Selah.

Offer the sacrifices of righteousness, And put your

          {+}
         trust in Yahweh.
